"    *   Answer: ___________ ____ (Savitribai Phule), _________ 1848 ___ ____ ___ ________ __ ___ ____ _____ ____ ____ ___"",4a87b3ae9df4cb91ad6a67b6de16d62c168c9aabd6ce612498d2cd2d0941fb31,stop,""{""""completion_tokens"""":604,""""prompt_tokens"""":299,""""prompt_tokens_details"""":{""""cached_tokens"""":7},""""total_tokens"""":903}"",2026-10-19T11:51:19.895085+00:00"
"qa:hi:xorqa-hi-172,2802a4f58b02cd2890cd8725537fcfa55dcfcfe430d30c07f722e7a73bc710f0,qa,hi,Hindi,xorqa-hi-172,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Answer the question using the supplied context. Respond in Hindi. Give a concise answer; include an explanation only if the question requires one.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""context\"""": \""""Leif Erikson or Leif Ericson ( 970 Ð c. 1020) was a Norse explorer from Iceland. He was the first known European to have set foot on continental North America (excluding Greenland), before Christopher Columbus. According to the Sagas of Icelanders, he established a Norse settlement at Vinland, tentatively identified with the Norse L'Anse aux Meadows on the northern tip of Newfoundland in modern-day Canada. Later archaeological evidence suggests that Vinland may have been the areas around the Gulf of St. Lawrence and that the L'Anse aux Meadows site was a ship repair station.\"""",\n  \""""question\"""": \""""_______ __ ________ _____ ____?\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",____ _______ (Leif Erikson) ______ _______ ___ ___ ____ ____ ____ _____ _______ ___,""*   Context: Information about Leif Erikson (Norse explorer, first European to set foot on continental North America, established settlement at Vinland, etc.)."
"*   Question: """"_______ __ ________ _____ ____?"""" (Who discovered America?)"
"*   Constraints: Answer in Hindi, concise, include explanation only if required, use supplied context."

"    *   Context states: """"He [Leif Erikson] was the first known European to have set foot on continental North America (excluding Greenland), before Christopher Columbus."""""
    *   The question asks who discovered America. The context provides that Leif Erikson was the first known European to set foot on continental North America.

    *   Direct answer: Leif Erikson.
    *   Refining the answer based on context: Leif Erikson was the first known European to set foot on continental North America.

"    *   """"____ _______ (Leif Erikson) ________ ______ _______ (_________ __ ______) ___ ___ ____ ____ ____ _____ _______ ___"""""

    *   Answer in Hindi? Yes.
    *   Concise? Yes.
"    *   Include explanation only if required? The question is a """"Who"""" question. A direct answer is best."
    *   Use supplied context? Yes.

