"""",\n  \""""question\"""": \""""__________ ______________ _____ ____ ___ _______?\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""______ ________ _______ _____ ______ 379 ____ _________, ______ _________ _________ _______ ______ ______ 1,000 ____ ______________."",""*   Context: A paragraph describing the Jallianwala Bagh massacre (April 13, 1919). It provides different casualty figures:"
"        *   Official British Indian sources (Dyer's letter): 379 dead, ~1,100 wounded."
"        *   Indian National Congress estimate: ~1,000 dead, >1,500 injured."
"    *   Question (in Kannada): """"__________ ______________ _____ ____ ___ _______?"""" (How many people died in the Jallianwala massacre?)"
