    *   The context says Kennedy was running to replace *incumbent* President Dwight D. Eisenhower.
"    *   Kennedy and Johnson won the election in November 1960, but they were sworn in on January 20, 1961."
"    *   Therefore, in 1960, the incumbent President was Dwight D. Eisenhower (until the transition in Jan 1961)."

