"qa:ml:xorqa-ml-413,90ba3a1235508065c6fc3b4c1f7b54e27f66191fc4c6945f7e705f0016c5bb87,qa,ml,Malayalam,xorqa-ml-413,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Answer the question using the supplied context. Respond in Malayalam. Give a concise answer; include an explanation only if the question requires one.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""context\"""": \""""Born in Yate, Gloucestershire, England, Rowling was working as a researcher and bilingual secretary for Amnesty International when she conceived the idea for the \\\""""Harry Potter\\\"""" series while on a delayed train from Manchester to London in 1990. The seven-year period that followed saw the death of her mother, birth of her first child, divorce from her first husband and relative poverty until the first novel in the series, \\\""""Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone\\\"""", was published in 1997. There were six sequels, of which the last, \\\""""Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows\\\"""", was released in 2007. Since then, Rowling has written five books for adult readers: \\\""""The Casual Vacancy\\\"""" (2012) andÑunder the pseudonym Robert GalbraithÑthe crime fiction novels \\\""""The Cuckoo's Calling\\\"""" (2013), \\\""""The Silkworm\\\"""" (2014), \\\""""Career of Evil\\\"""" (2015), and \\\""""Lethal White\\\"""" (2018).\"""",\n  \""""question\"""": \""""____ ___________ ____ ______ _________ __ __ _______ _________________?\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",1997-_.,""*   Context: A short biography of J.K. Rowling, mentioning her work at Amnesty International, the conception of Harry Potter on a train in 1990, personal struggles, the publication of the first novel """"Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone"""" in 1997, sequels, and later books."
"    *   Question: """"____ ___________ ____ ______ _________ __ __ _______ _________________?"""" (When did J.K. Rowling publish the first Harry Potter series/novel?)"
"    *   Task: Answer in Malayalam, be concise, include explanation only if required."

    *   The question asks about the publication year of the first Harry Potter book.
"    *   The context states: """"...until the first novel in the series, 'Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone', was published in 1997."""""

