"    *   At the beginning of 1960 (and for much of the year until January 20, 1961), the incumbent President was Dwight D. Eisenhower."
    *   Kennedy won the election in 1960 but was sworn in in 1961.
"    *   The question """"Who was the President in 1960?"""" can be interpreted as """"Who held the office during 1960?""""."
"    *   According to the text: Dwight D. Eisenhower was the incumbent President. Kennedy replaced him, but the transition happened in 1961."

