    *Final Answer Formulation:*
"    _____ _____ ______ _________ 37.0 ¡C (98.6 ¡F)_ _________ 35 ¡C (95 ¡F) __ ___ ____ __________ ___ 37.5-38.3 ¡C (99.5-100.9 ¡F) __ ____ ____ ___________ _______"",19d4285b4439274879e2ee04a4607953d08f703e287c124619de06be872f44eb,stop,""{""""completion_tokens"""":1476,""""prompt_tokens"""":273,""""prompt_tokens_details"""":{""""cached_tokens"""":7},""""total_tokens"""":1749}"",2026-10-19T12:08:22.028838+00:00"
