"    *   Context: Information about poultry production (global share, annual numbers, production volume, top producers, production models)."
"    *   Question: """"_____ ____ ____ _____ ________ ___ _____ __?"""" (In which country are most chickens found/produced?)"

"    *   """"The largest producers were the United States (20%), China (16.6%), Brazil (15.1%) and the European Union (11.3%)."""""

"    *   Question: """"In which country are chickens most found/produced?"""""
    *   Fact: United States (20%) is the largest producer.

    *   Answer: ______ ___ (United States).
    *   More complete but concise: ______ ___ (United States) __ ___ ____ ______ ___ (United States is the largest producer.)

"    *   """"______ ___ (United States) __ ___ ____ ______ ___"""""

