"qa:te:xorqa-te-228,3536e2896507bac5ea3cce98a3e92a6a90705d40dc58fe759ccd4bd70f65a266,qa,te,Telugu,xorqa-te-228,gemma26b,494a4e4c54ae4f5b32ec6e0c7cc734f654652cba2d79b1246a5eb8f3f3508ec3,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Answer the question using the supplied context. Respond in Telugu. Give a concise answer; include an explanation only if the question requires one.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""context\"""": \""""It is bordered on the west by the Pacific Ocean and on the north and east by the Atlantic Ocean; North America and the Caribbean Sea lie to the northwest. It includes twelve sovereign states (Argentina, Bolivia, Brazil, Chile, Colombia, Ecuador, Guyana, Paraguay, Peru, Suriname, Uruguay, and Venezuela), a part of France (French Guiana), and a non-sovereign area (the Falkland Islands, a British Overseas Territory though this is disputed by Argentina). In addition to this, the ABC islands of the Kingdom of the Netherlands, Trinidad and Tobago, and Panama may also be considered part of South America.\"""",\n  \""""question\"""": \""""______ _______ _______ _____ ______ _______?\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",______ _________ ________ ________ ______ _______.,""*   Context: A description of South America's boundaries and composition. It mentions twelve sovereign states (Argentina, Bolivia, Brazil, Chile, Colombia, Ecuador, Guyana, Paraguay, Peru, Suriname, Uruguay, and Venezuela), French Guiana (part of France), and the Falkland Islands (British Overseas Territory). It also mentions ABC islands, Trinidad and Tobago, and Panama might be considered part of it."
