"    ________ ________ _____ _______ 379 ____ _________, ____ _______ ______ _________ _____ _______ ______ 1,000 ____ _________."",7678f06f40506a85fbac179b1a737cc5d250fb0cc53f6f894fcca42d4d9f1eb5,stop,""{""""completion_tokens"""":639,""""prompt_tokens"""":428,""""prompt_tokens_details"""":{""""cached_tokens"""":7},""""total_tokens"""":1067}"",2026-10-19T12:26:53.858168+00:00"
