"_________: _____ _______ _______ ______________, ___ _____________ _____________ _________ ___________ ______ ___________ ___ ____________ ________. ______, '___________ _______' ____ ___________ _______ ___________ _____ _____ ____________."",""*   Premise: """"_________ ___________ _______."""" (Homeowners searched in the neighborhood.)"
