"        *   ________: __________ _____ ___ ________ _________ __ ________ """"______ _____ ___"""" ___ ______ ______ ___ _______ _______ ________ _______ (Criticism: Human rights workers and the family's lawyer have called this death """"avoidable"""" and criticized the government's role.)"
