"    *(Self-correction: The text says she """"is due to be given a lethal injection... on 12 January"""". It doesn't specify the year in the text, but contextually it's current/upcoming. I'll stick to what the text says. The text says """"12 January"""". I will omit the year if it's not explicitly in the text to avoid """"unsupported facts"""", though common sense implies current. Let's stick to """"12 _________"""".)*"

