"    *   Input Data: A text about hidden camera crimes (molka) in South Korea, protests by women, legal issues, statistics, and government response."

    *   *Core Issue:* Hidden camera crimes (non-consensual filming/photography) in South Korea.
"    *   *Protests:* Women (mostly teens/20s) protesting against the crime, demanding harsher punishments. They used slogans like """"My life is not your porn."""""
"    *   *Statistics/Scale:* Significant rise in crimes (1,100 in 2010 to 6,500+ in 2017). Large scale of protests (55k vs 20k people)."
