    *   *Underreporting:* General reluctance to talk makes real numbers likely higher.
    *   *Statistics:* 2007 study showed 53% of children surveyed faced sexual abuse.
"    *   *Nature of Abusers:* Most abusers are known people (parents, relatives, teachers)."

