"    *   *Central Message:* The Easter Sunday attacks in Sri Lanka, which targeted churches and hotels, have led to investigations into both local (NTJ) and foreign (IS) links, alongside major security restructuring by the Sri Lankan government."

    *   *Supporting Points:*
