"        *   *Impact on US:* A """"geopolitical blunder"""" (deporting expertise that eventually built missiles used against US interests)."
"    *   *Central Message/Theme:* The irony of the US deporting a brilliant scientist due to anti-communist hysteria, which ultimately fueled China's rise as a space superpower. It's a cautionary tale about expelling talent."

