"    *   *Event:* Posted an Instagram photo breastfeeding her baby while her daughter Luna's doll was also """"being fed."""""
"    *   *Reaction (Positive):* 3 million likes on Instagram, 18,000 on Twitter. Campaigners use #normalizebreastfeeding."
    *   *Reaction (Negative):* Criticism about the nature of the photo; calls for her to cover up; some users find it uncomfortable despite it being natural.
