"        *   Current law (since 1876): Marriage requires parental consent for under-20s (men at 18, women at 16)."
"        *   Proposed change: Marriage age for women raised to 18 to match men, so all 18-year-olds have full legal autonomy for marriage/contracts."
"        *   Restrictions: Smoking, drinking alcohol, and gambling remain banned until age 20."
