"    *   *Supporting Information (The """"How""""):* _____ _____ ___________ ____ ____ ______ _________ ____________ ____ ____ _ ______ ____. _____ _____ _________ ___ ____ ___________ ________ ______ _______ ______ _____ __. _ ______, ______ ___ ___ __________ _____ _____ ____ ___ ___ ____ ____ _____ _________ ____ ____ _____ ___. (He did this by reporting large losses in his businesses to avoid income tax. The report says his golf resorts and other businesses have millions in losses. Additionally, despite large income from foreign revenue and branding deals, he received significant tax relief.)"
