"    *   *Central Message:* The diplomatic tension between French President Emmanuel Macron and Brazilian President Jair Bolsonaro has escalated due to disrespectful remarks made by Bolsonaro regarding Brigitte Macron, following a dispute over the Amazon wildfires."
