"    *   *Context:* _______ _________ _____ ____ _____________ ______ _____ __, ______ __________ _ _____ _______ __ """"_____________ ________""""__ ____ _____ __. (Macron calls the Amazon fires an international crisis, while Bolsonaro accuses Macron of """"colonialist mentality."""")"
