    *   *Supporting Info 2 (Production/SII):* ____ ____________ __ _______ ____ ____ ______ _______ ______ ______ ____ ______ ___ ___ __. ______ ________ ___ _______ __________ _____ _______ __________ ______ _______ ________ ___ ___ __. (Major companies like SII are struggling to increase production. Past accidents and financial constraints are hindering targets.)

