"        Yeh article batata hai ki racial violence ke videos dekhna Black logon ke liye bahut dardnak hai. George Floyd jese videos sirf khabrein nahi hain, balki unke liye ek trauma hai. Log kehte hain video dekhna zaroori hai sachai ke liye, lekin Black logon ke liye ye unki mental health ke liye bura hai. Unhe lagta hai ki ye unki asli zindagi hai. Social media par dikhava karne wale log bhi hain. Ant mein, mental health sabse zaroori hai."

