"    *   Input data (JSON): A text about Ms. Gandhi (Sonia Gandhi) facing internal party dissent in the Congress party, the reasons for the decline of the Congress party, the specific demands of the dissidents, and the outcome of the recent meeting."

    *   *Core Event:* Ms. Gandhi faced pressure to resign due to a letter from dissidents calling for reforms.
"    *   *Outcome:* After a 7-hour meeting, she agreed to stay temporarily; a new leader will be elected within six months."
"    *   *Context (Congress Decline):* Congress has been losing elections since 2014 (BJP's rise under Modi). They lost control of states and saw a decline in seats (44 in 2014, poor results in 2019). Analysts blame poor leadership and the dominance of the Gandhi family."
"    *   *Details of Dissent:* 23 senior leaders (including Kapil Sibal, Shashi Tharoor, etc.) wrote a letter calling for reforms like an independent election authority and leadership mechanisms."
    *   *Ms. Gandhi's Reaction:* She expressed hurt but called for unity. She'll work with a new committee to aid day-to-day operations.
    *   *Current Status:* She's in an interim role; the party will meet in six months to elect a new leader.

"    *   *Central Message:* ________ ______ ___ ______ _______ __ _______ __ ____ __ ___, ______ _____ __ _______ ___ __ __ __ ___ ____ __ _____ ____ __ __ __ _____ __ ____ __ ____ __ _____ __ _________ ____ _____ (After internal rebellion and demands for reforms, Sonia Gandhi has decided to stay in office temporarily and a process to elect a new leader within six months will begin.)"

