"summarization:hi:crosssum-hi-366,30cb8e6ad961c787925cfe7fe6be421face6f778fadce3b964a41d5d9260f514,summarization,hi,Hindi,crosssum-hi-366,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Summarize the supplied document in Hindi. Give a concise summary of the central message and essential supporting information. Do not add unsupported facts. Return only the summary.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""document\"""": \""""The red phone, which has the Nazi leader's name engraved on it, was found in his Berlin bunker in 1945. Soviet soldiers gave it to British officer Sir Ralph Rayner as a souvenir shortly after Germany surrendered. Auction house Alexander Historical Auctions says bidding in Chesapeake City, Maryland, will start at $100,000 (£80,567). It hopes that the phone, which is being sold by Sir Ralph's son Ranulf, can fetch as much as $300,000. Auction house official Bill Panagopulos said the phone was a \\\""""weapon of mass destruction\\\"""", as it was used by Hitler to give orders that took many lives during the war, the Associated Press reports.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""_____ __ ___ ____ __ ___ ___, __ 1945 ___ ______ __ ____ __ ____ __, ________ ___ ______ __ ___ ___ ___ ___ ______ _______ ______ _______ _______ __ _____ ____ __ _____ ___ ___ __ __ ___ __ ______ $100,000 __ ____ ____ $300,000 __ ____ __ ______ ___ __ ___ __ _____ __ _____ ____ ____ ____ __ ____ __ """"_______ _____ __ ______"""" ____ ____ ___"",""*   Task: Summarize the provided document."
