"        *   ____ ___ ____ ___ __ __ __________ ___ _______ ______ ________ __ ______ ______ _________ __ ______ __ ____, ______ ___ ________ __ ____ ____ __ _____ ___ (Investigation found that this disinformation spread through suspicious Twitter accounts and Indian media houses, with some accounts linked to India.)"
        *   _____ __ _______ _________ __ __________ ______ __ __ _____ __ ____ ____ __ ___ __ _______ __________ ______ ______ (Karachi residents and Pakistani media refuted these claims and called it a coordinated disinformation campaign.)

