"    *   *Charges against Huawei (Trade secrets):* Attempting to steal T-Mobile's robot technology (Tappy). Alleged violation of non-disclosure agreement, taking photos/notes/parts of the robot arm. Huawei previously settled a civil case with T-Mobile but now faces criminal charges."
    *   *Context:* Occurs during high-level US-China trade talks; tensions over Meng's arrest in Canada for extradition.
