"    *   *Key Statistics:* """"Almost zero progress"""" in the last decade regarding school places in the poorest countries. 600 million children in school learn almost nothing (quality issue)."
"    *   *Gender Disparity:* In sub-Saharan Africa, girls are more likely to miss out."
