    *   *Details about Sharmeena Begum:* 15 years old; left in December; father (Mohammad Uddin) warned authorities; believed she was groomed via social media; her behavior changed after her mother's death (became more religious/wore scarf); she told her father she was in ISIS and wasn't coming back.
"    *   *Details about others:* Amira Abase (15), Shamima Begum (15), Kadiza Sultana (16); they left on Feb 17; flew to Istanbul; footage shows them being helped into a car near the border."
