"*   Source Material: An article about the """"International Alliance for Cancer Early Detection,"""" a collaboration between major universities (Cambridge, Manchester, UCL, Stanford, etc.) and Cancer Research UK to improve early cancer detection through lab models, non-invasive tests (blood, breath, urine), and advanced imaging."

"    *   *Central Message:* A new international alliance (Cancer Research UK, Cambridge, Manchester, UCL, Stanford, etc.) has been formed to revolutionize early cancer detection."
