    *   *Refining for Conciseness and Flow (Kannada):*
"        1992_ ______________ ____________ ____ ______ ______ ______ _______ _ ______, _______ ____ ____________ _____ _____ ______ _____ ______________ ___________________ _________. ________ 5 ____ ____ _____ '________'_____ __________ ______ _____________ _____ ____________ ______ __________ ____________ ______________ ______ ____ ____________ ______________. ______ ____ ______ ______ ____, _____________ ________ ________ ____ _________ ____ _____ _______ _____ ______ _____ ______________. ________ ______ _ _____________ _____ _____________ _________. _____ 25 ______ ______ _ _________ ______ ____________ ______ _________________ _____ ___________."

