"    *   *Pricing/Availability:* iPhone 12 (£799), Mini (£699), Pro/Pro Max starting at £999/£1,099."

"    *   *Central Message:* Apple has unveiled its new iPhone 12 series, featuring 5G technology, the new iPhone Mini, and significant hardware/camera improvements."
    *   *Supporting Info:*
"        *   iPhone 12 features 5G, A14 Bionic chip, ceramic shield, and OLED display."
        *   Pro models include LiDAR sensors for better photography and AR.
