"    *   *Key Issue 2: T-Mobile Robot (Tappy):* Huawei faces 10 criminal charges including theft of trade secrets. Allegedly, Huawei engineers tried to steal technology from T-Mobile's """"Tappy"""" robot by taking photos/notes/parts, violating an NDA. Huawei previously settled a civil case on this, but this is a new criminal indictment."
