"    *   *Impact:* Resignations of the head (Sara Danius), Katarina Frostenson, and four other members. Only 11 members remain (quorum needed is 12). This is the biggest scandal since 1901."
"    *   *Academy's Stance:* They need to rebuild trust, change internal practices, and restore their complement of members."
    *   *Historical Context:* The prize has rarely been skipped (only in 1935 and during world wars).
