    *   Constraint 2: Return *only* the summary.
"    *   Input Data: A JSON object containing a short text about red dye flooding in Jenggot, Java, Indonesia."

"    *   *Event:* Crimson/red dye released into the streets of Jenggot, central Java, on Saturday."
    *   *Cause:* Flooding hit the batik (wax and dye) textile area.
"    *   *Location:* Jenggot, south of Pekalongan, central Java, Indonesia."
    *   *Details:* Social media images confirmed the red flood. Local official Dimas Arga Yudha said the dye will mix with rain and disappear.
"    *   *Context:* Pekalongan rivers often change color due to batik dyes (e.g., green water last month). Indonesia faces frequent flooding (Jakarta storm killed 43 people)."
    *   *Mitigation:* Local authorities used cloud seeding to prevent rain during the worst flooding since 2013.

"    *   *Central Message:* Flooding in Jenggot, Central Java, caused red dye from batik production to spill into the streets."
