    *   *Specific Changes:*
        *   Visas for 49 countries (details pending).
        *   Women no longer need to wear abayas (but must dress modestly).
        *   Unaccompanied women are allowed.
        *   No changes to restrictions on Mecca/Medina for non-Muslims.
        *   Alcohol ban remains.
"    *   *Tourism Focus:* UNESCO sites, Red Sea resorts, Qiddiya entertainment city."
