"    *   *Supporting Info 2 (Social Changes):* _____ _____________ ____ ____________ ________ _________, _______ __________ _____ _________ ______ _____. ________ _____________ __________ ____ _________. (The requirement for women to wear abayas is removed, and they can travel alone. However, modest dress is required.)"
