"summarization:ml:crosssum-ml-483,6a32b1072a466d0eb86801dd42f8481d2be3b786d131a09321fbf77cb9c54e20,summarization,ml,Malayalam,crosssum-ml-483,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Summarize the supplied document in Malayalam. Give a concise summary of the central message and essential supporting information. Do not add unsupported facts. Return only the summary.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""document\"""": \""""They are said to have been shot dead by family members earlier this week in a village on the border of the North and South Waziristan tribal districts. The murders came after a video appeared on social media showing the girls with a young man, police said. Two men were reportedly arrested on Sunday in connection with the case. The two men were the father of one of the victims and brother of the other victim, police officials told BBC Urdu. The incident is said to have taken place on Thursday afternoon at Shamplan village, in Garyom region on the border between North and South Waziristan districts in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa province, according to police. The reason behind the killings of the two girls, aged 16 and 18, is believed to be a video, provided to the BBC, which shows a young man recording himself with three young girls in a secluded area outdoors. It appeared the video was shot nearly a year ago and most probably went viral on social media a few weeks ago, a senior police official told Dawn newspaper. \\\""""At the moment, our topmost priority is to secure the life of the third girl and the man before taking any action,\\\"""" the officer said. Human Rights Watch says that violence against women and girls remains a serious problem in Pakistan. Activists believe about 1,000 such \\\""""honour killing\\\"""" murders are carried out across the country every year. What is an 'honour killing'? It is the killing of a member of a family who is perceived to have brought dishonour upon relatives. Pressure group Human Rights Watch says the most common reasons are that the victim: But killings can be carried out for more trivial reasons, like dressing in a way deemed inappropriate or displaying behaviour seen as disobedient.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""____________ ____________, ___ ________________ ______ ______ ________ ____________________ 16, 18 _________ _____ ____________ '___ _________' (___________________________ ___________) ____ _______ _____________. _____________ _______ _____________ _ _____ _______. ________________ ______ _______ ___________ ________ __________ ____________ ____________________. ___________ _________ _________ ______ ___________ '___ _____________' _______ __________ _______________ ______ _________ ______ __________________."",""*   Task: Summarize the provided document."
    *   Language: Malayalam.
    *   Format: Concise summary of the central message and essential supporting information.
    *   Constraints: Do not add unsupported facts. Return *only* the summary.
"    *   Input Data (JSON): A news report about the murder of two girls in Waziristan (Pakistan) due to an """"honour killing"""" after a video went viral."

    *   *Event:* Two girls (aged 16 and 18) were shot dead.
"    *   *Location:* Shamplan village, border of North and South Waziristan, Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan."
    *   *Motive:* A video went viral on social media showing them with a young man. The video was likely a year old.
"    *   *Perpetrators (Suspects):* Two men arrested (one was the father of a victim, the other the brother of the other victim)."
    *   *Status of others:* Police are trying to protect a third girl and the man involved.
"    *   *Context:* Human Rights Watch notes violence against women is a major issue in Pakistan; approximately 1,000 """"honour killings"""" occur annually."
"    *   *Definition:* """"Honour killing"""" is the murder of family members perceived to have brought dishonour (due to dress, behavior, etc.)."

"    *   *Central Message:* Two girls were murdered in a """"honour killing"""" in Waziristan, Pakistan, after a video of them with a man went viral."
    *   *Key Details:*
        *   Victims' ages: 16 and 18.
"        *   Location: Shamplan village, Waziristan border."
        *   Suspects: Father of one victim and brother of the other.
        *   Context: Part of the larger issue of honour killings in Pakistan.

    *   *Drafting in English first:*
"        Two girls, aged 16 and 18, were killed in an """"honour killing"""" in Shamplan village, on the border of North and South Waziristan, Pakistan. The murders occurred after a video of them with a young man went viral on social media. Two men, identified as the father of one victim and the brother of the other, have been arrested in connection with the incident. Human Rights Watch highlights that such honor killings are a recurring issue in Pakistan, often triggered by perceived dishonour."

