"    *   *Central Message:* Las Vegas prosecutors decided not to file charges against Cristiano Ronaldo following sexual assault allegations from 2009, stating the claims could not be proven beyond a reasonable doubt."
    *   *Supporting Info:*
        *   Kathryn Mayorga alleged the assault in 2009.
        *   An out-of-court settlement occurred in 2010.
        *   The case was reopened in 2018 (influenced by #MeToo).
