"    _________ ________ ___________________ ___________________, __________ __________ _____________ _______________ ______ __tsin-___ ______________ ___________ ________ _________________ _________ __________________ _ _____ _____________. 1997-_ __tsin-____ ___________ ______ ____ _______ __________. ________ ______ _____________ ____________ ____________________ ______ __tsin-__ __________ __________ _____________ ___________ ______________. 1999-_ __tsin-____ ______________ __________ ________ _____ ____________. __tsin-____ _______ _____/______________________ _____, _____ ______ ______ ____________________ (authoritarian) ___ _____________ ______. _________ _________ ________ _____________ ________ ________ ______ ____________ _________ _________ __________________."

