"        *   iPhone 12 series includes a new """"Mini"""" model (5.4-inch screen)."
"        *   Introduction of 5G technology (faster downloads, streaming, gaming)."
"        *   Design changes: Sharper/flatter edges, """"Ceramic Shield"""" for better drop protection, OLED screens (richer colors, thinner bezels)."
