        *   MagSafe: Magnet array on the back for chargers/accessories.
"        *   Pro/Pro Max models: Larger screens, Lidar scanner (better autofocus/AR), better low-light camera."
        *   Environmental decision: No charger or headphones bundled with devices.
"    *   *Pricing/Availability:* iPhone 12 (£799), iPhone 12 Mini (£699), Pro models (£999/£1,099). Release dates: Oct 23 (iPhone 12) and Nov 13 (Mini)."
"    *   *Market Context:* 5G is a major driver; experts see this as a potential """"super-cycle"""" for upgrades. Competition/Network operator interest in 5G."
    *   *Other Products:* HomePod Mini (smart speaker).
