    *   *Key Figure 3: Thomas Thabane (The Husband/PM):* 80-year-old Prime Minister of Lesotho. Accused of having a relationship with Maesaiah while married to Lipolelo. His political career is at risk. His party wants him to resign; he says he's resigning due to age.
    *   *Key Figure 4: Holomo Molibeli (The Policeman):* Lesotho's senior policeman. Investigated the murder. He claims phone records link the PM to the crime scene. The PM has tried to remove him.

    *   *Central Message:* The murder investigation of Lipolelo Thabane has placed Lesotho's Prime Minister Thomas Thabane and his current wife Maesaiah Thabane at the center of a major political and criminal scandal.

