"        *   __ ________ ___________ ______ _________ _____ ______ ____ ____, ______ ____________ _____ ___ ___________ ____________ ___ __________ ________ _____ ___ ___. (This incident sparked widespread anger in Bangladesh, with demands for strict implementation of laws against sexual harassment and protection for victims.)"

