"    *   *Stan Lee's Legacy:* Famous for Marvel (Spider-Man, Avengers, X-Men). Created relatable characters with flaws (Hulk, Peter Parker). Characters like Professor X and Magneto have social allegories (Martin Luther King/Malcolm X)."
