"    *   *Themes/Topics:* Media coverage of women, """"unwanted"""" girls in India, nuns in Latin American prisons, Palestine's first female governor, daughter of a dictator, Syrian 'Malala' (Muzzon al-Mellehan), female entrepreneurs, nurses in war zones, etc."
"    *   *Diversity:* Entrepreneurs under 30, nurses, leaders in science, politics, education, arts."
