"*   Source Material: An article about the repatriation of foreign fighters, women, and children from IS-controlled territories in Syria and Iraq."

"    *   *Context:* IS """"caliphate"""" is ending. US and others want to repatriate detainees (men, women, children)."
    *   *Background:* Jihadists traveled to Iraq (post-2003) and Syria (post-2011 civil war). IS surge in 2014.
    *   *Statistics (ICSR/UN):*
"        *   UN: 40,000+ foreign fighters from 110 countries."
"        *   ICSR (2018): 41,490 people from 80 countries affiliated with IS (32,809 men, 4,761 women, 4,640 children)."
