"*   Input Format: JSON containing the """"document""""."

    *   *Core Subject:* Amnesty International report (and BBC investigation) regarding the Delhi riots (February 2020) triggered by the CAA.
    *   *Key Allegations against Delhi Police:*
"        *   Police brutality (beating protesters, torturing detainees)."
"        *   Complicity/collusion with Hindu mobs (throwing stones, acting with mobs)."
        *   Failure to act against hate speech by right-wing leaders.
        *   Disproportionate targeting of Muslims (higher casualties and property loss).
        *   Arresting civil rights activists/students/teachers (mostly Muslims) instead of hate speech makers.
    *   *Victim Impact:* Over 40 deaths; Muslims bore the brunt of violence and property loss.
    *   *Specific Examples:* Faizan (died due to police brutality); stone-throwing allegations; videos showing police with mobs.
    *   *Recommendations:* Independent inquiry into police conduct and human rights violations.
    *   *Other sources:* Delhi Minorities Commission also raised similar allegations.

"    *   *Central Message:* _________ ___________ _____ _________ __________ (CAA ___________ ______________) ______ ___________ ________ _____ ___________ _______ ____. ___________, _________ _____ _______ _________ ___ ____ ___ ___________ ______ ____. (Amnesty International report raises serious questions about Delhi Police's role in Delhi riots... accused of colluding with mobs and targeting Muslims.)"

