"        ______ _________ (WhatsApp) ___ _______ (Facebook) ________ ______ ___ ________ __ _Serious _____ _____ ___ _____, ____ ________ ___ _______ ________ ____ ______ ______ _______ ___________ __________ (encryption) _due to its private nature makes it difficult for fact-checkers to track misinformation, creating a """"black hole"""" effect. Misinformation has led to real-world violence, including mob lynchings. Both major political parties in India are accused of using these platforms for targeted and sometimes misleading campaigns. Although WhatsApp has introduced measures like limiting message forwarding and launching fact-checking services, the impact of fake news remains a significant challenge."

