"    *   *Proposed Solutions:* Move away from """"individual responsibility""""/education alone. Need systemic changes/environmental changes."
"        *   Examples: Portion control in packaged food, reformulation of fast/processed food, weight management, workplace fitness."
        *   These are more effective than taxes or public health campaigns.
    *   *Potential Benefit:* Long-term savings of £760m/year for the UK NHS if measures are taken.
    *   *Definition of Obesity (BMI):* Overweight > 25; Obese 30-40; Very obese > 40.
