"        *   Restrictions remaining: No alcohol, non-Muslims still can't visit Mecca and Medina."
        *   Economic Goal: Part of Mohammed bin Salman's reforms to reduce oil dependency; target 10% of GDP from tourism by 2030; 100 million visits/year; 1 million jobs.
"        *   Tourism sites: 5 UNESCO sites, Red Sea luxury resorts, Qiddiya entertainment city."
