        *   Democrats (Pelosi/Schumer): Criticized Trump's rhetoric.
"        *   Trump Family (Don Jr, Ivanka, Melania): Condemned the violence."
    *   *Outcome:* Most packages were intercepted before delivery; no one was physically harmed.

    *   *Central Message:* Multiple high-profile US political figures and media outlets have been targeted by a series of attempted mail attacks involving suspected pipe bombs.

    *   *Supporting Details:*
