        *   *Abdication:* Akihito (85) abdicated due to declining health. It required special legal permission.
"        *   *Emperor's Role:* Head of state, ceremonial duties (greeting dignitaries, religious ceremonies), no political power, must remain neutral."
"        *   *New Emperor (Naruhito):* Son of Akihito. His era is """"Reiwa"""" (meaning """"beautiful harmony""""). He expressed commitment to duty and world peace."
"        *   *Succession/Heirs:* Only males can ascend (Imperial Household Law). Concerns about male heirs (Naruhito has a daughter, Aiko; brother Fumihito has a son, Hisahito)."
"        *   *Future of Monarchy:* Debate exists regarding the necessity of the monarchy in modern Japan, though Akihito is widely liked."

