"    *   *What is it?* A 55km bridge connecting Hong Kong, Macau, and Zhuhai (part of China's Greater Bay Area plan)."
    *   *Cost/Construction:* $20bn. Designed for earthquakes/typhoons. Includes an undersea tunnel.
    *   *Purpose:* To cut travel time from Zhuhai to Hong Kong from 4 hours to 30 minutes.
    *   *Usage:* No private cars (need permits); toll required; no rail; private shuttle buses only; drivers must switch sides (left to right/right to left) to accommodate different driving rules.
