"    *Self-Correction:* """"______"""" is Hindi/Sanskrit. In Odia, """"______"""" (Adrushya) is used, but """"___________"""" (hasijaaichanti) or """"______"""" (ajnyata) is more natural. I'll use """"______"""" or just say """"___ ______ ______"""". Actually, """"______"""" is better for """"missing/unknown"""". Let's use """"______"""". Actually, """"______"""" is also used in Odia. Let's go with """"______""""."

