"        __ ___ _______ ____ ____ ______ (eunuchs) ______ ________ ___ ____ ______ ___ _____ ___ ______ ___ '__ ______ ____ _________ __ _____ _____ ___ ___ ___ __ ____ __ ________ _________ ____ """"_____ ____"""" (moral panic) ____ __ _____, ___ ___ ____ _____ __ ______ ___ _______ ___ ______ ___ __ _____ ______ ______ ________ _____ __ ________ 1871 __ ________ _____, ________ __ _____ __ _______ ___, _____ __ _______ '__ ______ _____ ___ _____ __ ____ (_____-_____) ___ ___ ___ __ ____ ___ ______ _________ __ _____ __ ___ ____ ____ ______ ___ __ """"_____ _____"""" ____ _____ ___ _____ ___ ___ __ ______ __ __ ______, ____ _____ _____ ____ ____ ____ ______ ___ ______ _________ __ ______ ____ ________ ___ ____-______ __ _____ ___ _____ ____ ___ ____ ___ ___ __ _____ _____ ____ ___ _____ ___"

