"    *   *International Reaction:* UK Foreign Secretary (Dominic Raab) called it an """"unacceptable curtailing of media freedom""""; US State Department condemned it as part of a campaign to suppress free media."
    *   *Background/Context:*
        *   Ofcom revoked CGTN's UK license (due to ownership/breach of regulations).
