"    *   *Central Message:* China has taken action against the BBC, including rejecting its broadcasting application, citing violations of news guidelines regarding reporting on COVID-19 and Uighurs. This, along with Hong Kong's RTHK stopping BBC radio programs, has drawn international condemnation for suppressing media freedom."

