    *   *Summary:*
"        _____ ____ ____ ____ ___ ___ ______ ____ _____ _____ _____ ______ ________ ______ _____ __ ___ ____ __ _____ ___ ___ __ _____ ____ 20 _____ _______ __ ___ ___ __, ___ __ _____ ______ ________ ______ ____ _____ ____ ___ __________ ____ __ _____ ___ ___ _____ _____ ____ ____ ____ _______ _____ ___ ____ _____ ______ _______ _____ (_____ __ _____) __ ______ ___ __ ____ __ ____ ____ _____ __ ____ ___ _______ _____ ______ __ ____ _____ __ ___________ ________ ______ __, __ LAC (____ __ ______ ______) __ ______ ___ __ __ _____ ______ ______ ___-____ '__ ____-_____ (accusations) _____ __ ________ ____ ___ _______ __ _____ __ __ __ ____ ___ _____ ______ ______ __ ____ __________ ___ ________ __ ___ ____ ___ _____ __ ____ ___"

