"    *Self-Correction during drafting:* Make sure to mention the """"rock-throwing/bludgeoning"""" part isn't strictly necessary for a *concise* summary unless it highlights the unusual nature, but the casualty count and the nature of the escalation are more essential. I'll stick to the essence."

