"    *   *Central Message:* Professor Richard Thaler has won the Nobel Prize in Economics for his groundbreaking work on behavioral economics and """"nudge"""" theory, which explores how human psychology influences economic decisions."
    *   *Supporting Info 1 (The Concept):* He demonstrated that people are often irrational and tend to choose what is easiest rather than what is wisest.
"    *   *Supporting Info 2 (Nudging):* """"Nudging"""" involves subtle changes (like placing healthy food at eye level) to guide better decision-making and self-control."
