"        *   Lower-income areas (e.g., South Asia, Eastern Africa) show much higher trust (95% in South Asia, 92% in Eastern Africa)."
        *   Examples of success: Rwanda (HPV vaccine access).
"    *   *Causes of Scepticism:* Lack of trust in scientists/doctors, complacency (diseases becoming rare), misinformation (internet/social media), and side-effect concerns."
    *   *Expert Advice:* Health workers need training to address concerns with scientific truth to counter misinformation.

