"    *   *Claim 2:* In 2017, 100M+ passengers flew domestic; more people flew by air than in AC train compartments."
    *   *Verdict 2:* True. 2016-17 domestic passengers were 103.75M. Total air passengers (158.43M) surpassed AC rail passengers (145.5M).
