"summarization:pa:crosssum-pa-35,94956696e6d5aa21f41b14237d3286f313ccd337d87a7edbbb206b11ec87c02e,summarization,pa,Punjabi,crosssum-pa-35,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Summarize the supplied document in Punjabi. Give a concise summary of the central message and essential supporting information. Do not add unsupported facts. Return only the summary.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""document\"""": \""""It is known for its exclusive guest list, its expensive tickets and - most of all - its extravagant outfits, based on a different theme each year. This year, that theme was Camp: Notes on Fashion - to coincide with an upcoming exhibition at the Met, inspired by US writer and political activist Susan Sontag's 1964 essay, Notes on Camp. The outfits this year were therefore, like the exhibition, based on \\\""""irony, humour, parody, pastiche, artifice, theatricality and exaggeration\\\"""". And showing everyone how it was done at the very start of the night was singer Lady Gaga, who arrived in a billowing pink outfit which was not quite what it seemed at first glance. All images subject to copyright\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""__ ___ __ _____ _____ """"____: ____ __ _____"""" _____ '__ _____ __, __ ___ ______ __ 1964 __ ___ ___ _______ ___ __ _____ __ ______, _______ _____, ________ ___ __-____ __ ____ ____ __ __, ___ __ _______ _____ ____ __Ga __ ___ ______ ______ _______ ___ _____"",""*   Task: Summarize the provided document."
