"    *   *Supporting Info 1:* ___ ___ __ _____ __ __ ______ _____ _____ ___ ___ ___ __ ___ ___ ______ _________ '__ ________ ____ __ ___ ___ __ __ ____ ___ __ __ ______ ____ (elite) ___ _____ __ ______ __ ___ ____ __, __ _____ _____ __ _____ ____ _____ __ __ ______ __ _____ ______ ___ (One side believes judicial intervention imposes modernity on traditions and urban elites ignore the voices of women supporting the tradition.)"
