"    _____ ______ '____-________' (anti-natalism) __ _____ ____ _______ _____ __, _____ _____ __ __ ____ ______ ___ ____ ____ __ ___ _______ ___ ______ ____ ___ __ ____ ______ __ ___ __ ____ ___ _____ __ _____ _____ __ __ ___ __ __ _____ ____ __ __ ______ ____ ___ ___ __ ____ ______ ____ __ ____, __ __ _____ ____ __ ______ _____ ______ ___ ____ __ _____ ___ ____ ___ __, __ ____ ______ (__ __ ____ __) '__ ___ ___ __ _____ ___ ____ __, _____ _____ _______ ___ '__ ______ ____ ____ ___ _____ _____ ___ __ ____ _______ ___ _______ _____ __ ____ ____ ___ ____ ____ ____ __ ______ ____ __ ___ __ ________ ____ __, _____ __ ____ _______ ___ _____ ____ ___"

