    *   *Potential Buyers:*
        *   IndiGo: Interested in international routes/operations but thinks buying the whole thing might be too challenging/loss-heavy.
        *   Vistara (Tata Group & Singapore Airlines): Open to a bid.
"        *   Jet Airways: Likely to look at it, perhaps with an international partner."
"        *   Potential international partners: Air France, Delta (rumored)."
