"    *   *Scientific/Social aspects:* __________ ______ __________ _________ _____________ ___ __________ ______________. ___________, __________ ____________ ____ _________ __________________ _______, ___ _________ ___ _______ __________ ________ ____________ ___________. (Mask-wearing is seen as a tool to encourage hygiene. However, there's social stigmatization for those not wearing them, and in some places, it's a debate over personal liberty.)"
"    *   *New evidence:* __________ _____________________ (asymptomatic carriers) ______ ______ _______ _____ ________, ________ __________ ____ __________ _________ ________ _______ ________________________. (New studies on asymptomatic transmission have brought the necessity of universal masking back into question.)"

