        *   Apple TV: 4K and HDR support.
        *   Software: iOS 11 with ARKit (Augmented Reality).

"    *   *Central Message:* _______ ________ ____ _____ _____ X (iPhone X) _ ______________________. ___ ___ __________ ______________ 'FaceID' _______ OLED ________ ___________. ______ _____ 8 _____, 4G _________ _______ ______ _______ 4K ____ _____ _______ ____ __________ _____________________. (Apple has introduced its new iPhone X. This features FaceID technology and an OLED display. Additionally, iPhone 8 series, 4G-capable Apple Watch, and 4K-enabled Apple TV were also introduced.)"

