"    *   Input: A text about the legal situation in Bahrain involving Sheikh Ali Salman, the Al-Wefaq movement, and the political context (Qatar-Bahrain relations, 2011 protests, etc.)."

"    *   *Core Event:* Bahraini court sentenced Sheikh Ali Salman (leader of Al-Wefaq) to life imprisonment for """"acts of hostility"""" and """"communicating with Qatari officials"""" to overthrow the order. This follows his acquittal on """"collusion"""" charges by a lower court."
