"    *   *Who are the Kurds?* Indigenous to Mesopotamia (Turkey, Syria, Iraq, Iran, Armenia). Distinct culture/language, mostly Sunni Muslims."
"    *   *The Struggle for a State (Kurdistan):* Post-WWI Treaty of Sevres promised a state; Treaty of Lausanne (1923) denied it, leaving them as minorities."
"    *   *War against IS (Islamic State):* Kurds (YPG in Syria, Peshmerga in Iraq) were key fighters against IS. US-led coalition helped. SDF (Syrian Democratic Forces) fought back IS in Syria. Turkey's involvement/stance is complex (sees YPG/PKK as terrorists)."
"    *   *Turkey's Position:* Deep hostility. Kurds were suppressed (denied identity, language). PKK (founded by Ocalan) fighting for autonomy/independence. Turkey views YPG/PYD as extensions of PKK."
