"    *   *What:* Performed the """"dab"""" dance move at a music festival in Taif."
    *   *Why it's a problem:* Dabbing is banned in Saudi Arabia by the National Commission for Combating Drugs because it's seen as a reference to marijuana use/narcotics culture.
"    *   *Reaction:* Video went viral. He apologized on Twitter, saying it was unintentional and spontaneous."
"    *   *Public opinion:* Divided. Some think it was provocative or a breach of law; others defend him, saying it was an accident and he has apologized."
    *   *Context:* Other celebrities (like Rabeh Sager) have also dabbed. The move originated in Atlanta hip-hop scene and became global.

"    *   *Central Message:* _____ ___________ _______ ______________ ___________ _______ _______ ________ ___ _____, _____ ______ ________ ___ _____ ____________ '____' (dab) _____ ___ _______ ________ _____ _________ __________________. (Saudi TV host/actor Abdallah Al Shahani caused controversy by performing the 'dab' dance move at a festival in Taif.)"

