    *   *Incident:* A woman was gang-raped and murdered. Her body was found under a flyover.
    *   *Parliamentary Reaction:* Jaya Bachchan (vocal about women's rights) and others demanded justice and government action. Vijila Sathyananth (MP) demanded the culprits be hanged by Dec 31. Rajnath Singh (Defence Minister) expressed shame and stated the government is open to discussing tougher laws.
"    *   *Public Reaction:* Widespread protests and vigils across India (e.g., Hyderabad). People demanding the death penalty. Social media (Twitter) trended her name."
