"    *   *Qatar's Status:* 11,000 citizens from those nations are in Qatar. Qatar will not retaliate."
    *   *Iran's Role:* Iran is sending food (planes/ships) to Qatar. Iran has opened its airspace. Analysts link the rift to Qatar's relations with Iran.
