"    *   *Drafting - Sentence 3 (Context/Standards):* __________ ______ ____________, ____ __________ _________ _________ ___________________ ______ _________ _______________ ______ _______________. (#MeToo ___________ ______________, __________ __________________ ______ _________ ______________ ____ _________ __________________.)"

    *   *Refining and Polishing:*
"        ______ (Oscars) ____ __________ ________________ ____ ______ _______ _____ __________ ____ __________ _____________. _______ _________ ________ ______________ __________________ ____ ______ _______ 1977-___ ___ ___________ ________ ________ _______ _______ ____________ _____ __________ ___________ ______ ____ _________ __________________. #MeToo ___________ _____________, __________ __________________ ______ ____________ ____ ____________ _______________ ______ _________ __________________."

    *   Summary provided in Tamil? Yes.
