"* **______ _______:** ________ _________ __________ ________ __________ ______ _______ ____, _______ ______ ______ _________ _____ ________ ____ ______ _________ _____ _______ _________ ___ _______ ______."",""*   Source material: A BBC interview/report featuring Dr. Manmohan Singh (architect of India's 1991 reforms)."
