"    *   *Funding & Global Trade:* ____________ ______________ _______ _________ _________ ___, ___ ______________ _________ _________ ___ _______. _______ __________ (Printing money) ____ ______ _____ ________ _______ _______ ____________. ________ _________ ______ ________ __________ ______ _____ _____ ____, __________ ______ ___________ ____ ______ _________ _______ _________ ___ ________. (Borrowing is necessary for growth; printing money is a last resort; global trade integration means global trends affect India.)"

