"    *   *Context:* Raœl Castro is stepping down as President of Cuba, to be replaced by Miguel D’az-Canel."
"    *   *D’az-Canel's background:* 57 years old, electrical engineer, long-time ally of Raœl Castro, groomed for this role, has """"ideological firmness."""""
