"    *   *Measures taken:* Disinfecting public spaces, mask mandates, propaganda about hygiene, unverified claims about cures (burdock)."
"    *   *Economic Impact:* Heavy hit to trade with China, smuggling, tourism, and diplomatic activities."
"    *   *Comparison to past crises:* Current response (COVID-19) is much more intense/high-profile than previous responses to Ebola, SARS, or H1N1."
