    *   *Wanda Diaz-Merced:* _____ _____-________ ____ ___________ ______ ______ ____ __________ ____ ________________ ______ ___________. (Wanda Diaz-Merced helped the visually impaired become astronomers through data sonification.)
    *   *Quarraisha Abdool Karim:* ________ _______ _____ _______________ ________/_______ __________ _________ ______. (Quarraisha Abdool Karim researched the spread of HIV/AIDS in South Africa.)
