"    *   *Event:* PM Modi announced the demonetization/scrapping of high-denomination notes (500 and 1,000 rupee notes) on a Tuesday evening."
"    *   *Goal:* To combat corruption and """"black money"""" (unaccounted cash/tax evasion) and eradicate poverty."
    *   *Immediate Impact:* Banks and ATMs closed (Wednesday); cash shortage expected; people rushing to ATMs.
"    *   *Action Items for Public:* Exchange old notes for new 500 and 2,000 rupee notes at banks. Deadline: Exchange at banks between Nov 10 and Dec 30. Airports, railway stations, hospitals accept old notes until Nov 11."
"    *   *Mechanisms:* Banks will monitor large cash exchanges. New notes (500 and 2,000) will be issued."
"    *   *Economic/Social Impact:* Potential deflationary impact (e.g., real estate); uncertainty in the short term; difficulty for small traders and those holding large amounts of cash at home."
