    *   *Core finding:* Lung cells that escape damage from smoking can actually repair/replenish the lungs after someone quits smoking.
"    *   *Context:* Mutations from smoking are permanent and occur on a massive scale (up to 10,000 alterations per cell) even before cancer develops."
"    *   *The """"Magic"""" Cells:* A small population of cells remains unscathed (like being in a """"nuclear bunker"""")."
