"    *   *Introduction (The Core Issue):* ______________ _____ (Sumba) ________ '_____ _________' (kawin tangkap) ___ ________ '______ _______' (bride kidnapping) ___ __________ ____ _______ _ ____ ____________. (This article explains the controversial practice of 'kawin tangkap' or bride kidnapping in Sumba island, Indonesia.)"
