"    *   *Government Action:* _____ _____ ________ _ ______ ________ _____ _______, __________ _________ ______ '_______ ____'__ _________, _ ______ ____ _______ _____________. ________ _______ ____ ______ ___________ ________ ______. (Following viral videos on social media, the Indonesian government has categorized this as violence against women and decided to end it. Regional leaders have also passed a resolution rejecting it.)"

