    *   *Government response:* President Ghani says the move doesn't win hearts; government will still fight IS.
"    *   *Context/Reasoning:* Follows a fatwa by clerics against violence (who were recently attacked by IS). No specific reason given by Taliban, but they might release prisoners."
    *   *International/US position:* US/coalition forces will honor the ceasefire.
