"translation:bn:floresplus-bn-1,5318694f543a882bb34f3ded845f21e23ec0d5932410f44cb35549ff704a7eed,translation,bn,Bengali,floresplus-bn-1,gemma26b,494a4e4c54ae4f5b32ec6e0c7cc734f654652cba2d79b1246a5eb8f3f3508ec3,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Bengali to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""bn\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""____________ _______ _______________ _______ _______ _______ __ ____ __, ____ _______ ___ _________ _________ ___________ ___________ _ _________ _______ _____, ___ _____ _____ ___ _________ __ ______ ____ ___ _____ ____ ______\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""Professor Dr. Ehud R., a professor in the Department of Medicine at Dalhousie University in Halifax and Chair of the Clinical and Scientific divisions of the Nova Scotia and Canadian Diabetes Association, had already warned that research is still in its early stages."",""*   Source language: Bengali (bn)"
