"    *   """"Alok"""" (Light) + """"Roshi"""" (Ray). """"Luminosity"""" is the standard term for star light output."
"    *   Actually, looking at the scientific context: The Rossby number ($Ro$) is $P_{rot} / \tau_{conv}$ (rotation period vs convective turnover time)."
