"translation:kn:floresplus-kn-30,c8fe52bd0ec3d13b0b84c50820ba3f2f3d85a98ffc72f334acbf4c91bf903748,translation,kn,Kannada,floresplus-kn-30,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Kannada to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""kn\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""________ _________ ___________ _________ ______ ______ ___ ________ __________ __________, ____ ________ ___ _________ ____ ______ _____ ____________  __________, _ ____ ____________ _____ ______  _____ ___________ ____ ________ ________ _________.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""Since dinosaur wings lack a fully developed rachis, but possess other feather features such as barbs and barbules, researchers believe that the rachis may have evolved after these other features."",""*   Source Language: Kannada (kn)"
*   Target Language: English (en)
"*   Source Text: """"________ _________ ___________ _________ ______ ______ ___ ________ __________ __________, ____ ________ ___ _________ ____ ______ _____ ____________ __________, _ ____ ____________ _____ ______ _____ ___________ ____ ________ ________ _________."""""
"*   Constraint: Preserve meaning, important details, and tone. Return *only* the translation."

"    *   """"________ _________"""" (Dainos_r rekkega_u) = Dinosaur wings."
"    *   """"___________ _________ ______"""" (Samp_r_av_gi abhivr_ddhi hondida) = fully developed."
"    *   """"______ ___ ________"""" (R_chis emba g__avannu) = a rachis (a central shaft-like structure). *Note: """"___"""" usually means nest, but in this anatomical context, it refers to the rachis/shaft of a feather.*"
"    *   """"__________ __________"""" (hondillade iruvudindal) = because [they] do not have."
"    *   """"____"""" (_dare) = but."
"    *   """"________ ___ _________ ____"""" (rekkega_a itara vai_i__ya ga__da) = other features of feathers."
"    *   """"______ _____ ____________"""" (b_rb mattu b_rbyu_s) = barbs and barbules."
"    *   """"__________"""" (iruvudindal) = because [they] have."
"    *   """"_ ____ ____________ _____"""" (_ b_re lak_a_aga_iginta anantara) = after these other features / subsequent to these other features."
"    *   """"______ _____ ___________"""" (r_chis vikasana hondirabahudu) = rachis might have evolved."
