"translation:kn:floresplus-kn-36,d11e5cbb1100491353834f0f1b1093c91d92c9dcfdecbbd3b529473913008529,translation,kn,Kannada,floresplus-kn-36,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Kannada to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""kn\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""_____ __________ _____ ___________ _____ __________ ____ ___________________ ____ _____ __ ______ __________ _________ ____ __________.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""They discovered that all stars function based on their brightness and rotation, and the Sun is no exception to this."",""*   Source language: Kannada (kn)"
