    Let's go with the most professional technical translation.

"    """"802.11n operates on 2.4GHz and 5.0GHz frequencies."""""",24ae0e1f4bc268c46bb4751b173beaf7b58f06dc0935a49daf0a580e157c231b,stop,""{""""completion_tokens"""":1008,""""prompt_tokens"""":116,""""prompt_tokens_details"""":{""""cached_tokens"""":7},""""total_tokens"""":1124}"",2026-10-19T16:11:34.090104+00:00"
