"translation:kn:floresplus-kn-45,e54ec76bb20f7a775a9255faa48ad5b2d49c2983538fe8101228d720ec3ca26f,translation,kn,Kannada,floresplus-kn-45,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Kannada to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""kn\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""_______ _______ ___________ ________ _______, \\\""""______________ ____ _____ _____________...____ ________________ ______ ____ ___ ________________ ____ _________ ________________\\\"""" ____ _______.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""When asked to respond, Miller said, """"There are people listening, Mike talks a lot... I was getting ready, so I didn't really listen to what they were saying."""""",""*   Source language: Kannada (kn)"
    *   Target language: English (en)
