"    *   """"____ _______"""" (endu h__idaru) -> said."

"    *   *Literal:* When asked to respond, Miller said, """"There are listeners, Mike talks too much... I was getting ready, so I didn't really listen to what they were saying."""""

    *   *Refining the flow:*
