"    """"In light of the bravery with which survivors of Larry Nassar recounted the intensity of their trauma, which went unnoticed for so long, and by embracing necessary and appropriate changes, USA Gymnastics supports an independent investigation."""""

"    *Actually, looking at the Malayalam again:* """"_____________ ______"""" -> """"intensity of their humiliation/trauma"""". In English, """"intensity of the trauma"""" is much more natural."

    Let's do one more check.
