    This sounds professional and accurate.

"    *One more consideration:* Is """"______"""" referring to the """"shame"""" they felt or the """"humiliation"""" caused by the abuse? In English, """"trauma"""" covers the experience."

    Final choice:
"    """"In light of the bravery with which survivors of Larry Nassar recounted the intensity of their trauma, which went unnoticed for so long, and by embracing necessary and appropriate changes, USA Gymnastics supports an independent investigation."""""",1b0e734ba6acc53f9a1afe428922c377aa5ea0e80f171cf08883749b6d9bef10,stop,""{""""completion_tokens"""":1813,""""prompt_tokens"""":158,""""prompt_tokens_details"""":{""""cached_tokens"""":7},""""total_tokens"""":1971}"",2026-10-19T16:17:23.556433+00:00"
