"    *   """"On Monday, Sara Danius, the Permanent Secretary of the Nobel Committee for Literature of the Swedish Academy, during a program on Sweden's Sveriges Radio, publicly announced that they had given up the effort to reach Bob Dylan directly regarding winning the 2016 Nobel Prize in Literature."""""

    *   *Refining for natural English flow:*
