"    *Self-Correction on """"they/she"""":* In Odia, """"__"""" (she) is used for Sara Danius, but the context of the committee's effort often implies """"they"""" (the committee). However, the text specifically says """"__ ________ __________"""" (she had given up). Let's stick closer to the grammatical subject. """"She had given up the effort to reach him directly..."""""

