    *   *Literal translation:*
"        The dinosaur's feathers are not well-developed soft [parts], which is called rachis, but it has other characteristics - barbs and barbules - therefore researchers have reached the conclusion that compared to other characteristics, rachis might have been a late aberrant evolution."

