"        *   The text says: The feathers of the dinosaur were not well-developed """"soft"""" [parts/structure], which is called the rachis, but it has other features - barbs and barbules - therefore researchers have reached the conclusion that compared to other features, the rachis might have been a later divergent evolution."

    *   *Polishing for flow and tone:*
