"    Actually, looking at the Odia """"_____ _____"""" (soft nahi), it's possible the author meant """"shaft"""" but wrote """"soft"""" or used """"soft"""" as a descriptor. I will stick to """"soft"""" as it is what is written."

    *Final check of the Odia:*
