"translation:or:floresplus-or-31,d0872ded1570ed1958e51fdaf0e23561a85637bc21034c4eeaaed7def7ab5043,translation,or,Odia,floresplus-or-31,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Odia to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""or\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""_____ ___ ___ ________ __ _______ __________ _______ ___________ ___ _________ _________ _______ _ __________ _______ _______ _________ ___ _______ ________ __, ____ ___ __ ___ _____ ________ _____ ___ _____ _______ ___ _____ ___ _______ ____ ___ ______ _\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""The wing structure indicates that they were not used for flight, but for thermoregulation and display. Researchers have suggested that although it is the tail of a young dinosaur, it appears as mature as a specimen that is not small."",""*   Source Language: Odia (or)"
    *   Target Language: English (en)
"    *   Source Text: """"_____ ___ ___ ________ __ _______ __________ _______ ___________ ___ _________ _________ _______ _ __________ _______ _______ _________ ___ _______ ________ __, ____ ___ __ ___ _____ ________ _____ ___ ______ _______ ___ _____ ___ _______ ____ ___ ______ _"""""

"    *   *Sentence 1:* """"_____ ___ ___ ________ __ _______ __________ _______ ___________ ___ _________ _________ _______ _ __________ _______ _______"""""
        *   _____ (Denara) = Of the wing / The wing's
