        *   *Draft 1:* The structure of the wing shows that they were not used for flight but were used for regulating temperature and display.

"    *   *Sentence 2:* """"_________ ___ _______ ________ __, ____ ___ __ ___ _____ ________ _____ ___ ______ _______ ___ _____ ___ _______ ____ ___ ______ _"""""
        *   _________ (Gabeshakamane) = Researchers
