"        """"Researchers have suggested that although it is the tail of a young dinosaur, it appears as mature as if it were not small for its specimen."""" (Actually, looking at the grammar, it's more likely: """"Researchers have suggested that although it is the tail of a young dinosaur, it appears as mature as [the fact that] it is not small for its specimen."""")"

