"    *   Text: """"____ _________ _______, ____________ ________ ______ _______ ___________ _______ ________ __________ _______ _____________."""""
"    *   Goal: Translate while preserving meaning, details, and tone. Return *only* the translation."

"    *   """"____ _________"""" (Indha arivippu) -> This announcement / This statement"
"    *   """"_______"""" (Trump) -> Trump"
"    *   """"____________ ________"""" (Thurukkiyin janathipathi) -> President of Turkey"
"    *   """"______ _______ ___________"""" (Recep Tayyip Erdogan-udan) -> with Recep Tayyip Erdo_an"
