"translation:ta:floresplus-ta-26,9792bf577bb367147dea04ac5f8c456d45830be0317e03581034c67f12c4a3cb,translation,ta,Tamil,floresplus-ta-26,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Tamil to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""ta\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""____ ______________ ______________ ISIS _________ ____________ ________ ________ _________________ _______ ________ _______ ________ ______ _____________ _______ _______.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""According to the report, Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, and European countries have refused to repatriate them."",""*   Source language: Tamil (ta)"
    *   Target language: English (en)
"    *   Text: """"____ ______________ ______________ ISIS _________ ____________ ________ ________ _________________ _______ ________ _______ ________ ______ _____________ _______ _______."""""
"    *   Goal: Translate to English, preserving meaning, details, and tone. Return *only* the translation."

"    *   """"____ ______________"""" (Anta arikkaiyin-padi): According to that report / As per that report."
"    *   """"______________"""" (Kaippatrap-patta): Captured / Seized / Taken into custody."
"    *   """"ISIS _________"""" (ISIS por__ika_ai): ISIS fighters."
"    *   """"____________ ________"""" (p_tuk_kkum poruppai): responsibility of protecting / custody / holding."
"    *   """"________ _________________"""" (Turukki e_uttukko__um): Turkey will take / Turkey is taking."
"    *   """"_______"""" (matrum): and."
"    *   """"________ _______"""" (Airoppiya n__uka_): European countries."
"    *   """"________ ______ _____________"""" (thiruppi anuppa maruthu-vi__ana): have refused to send back / have refused repatriation."
"    *   """"_______ _______"""" (enrum k__iyathu): also said / stated that."

"    *   *Literal:* According to that report, it said that Turkey will take responsibility for protecting captured ISIS fighters and European countries have refused to send them back."
"    *   *Refined:* The report stated that Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, while European countries have refused to take them back."
"    *   *More natural/Journalistic:* According to the report, Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, whereas European countries have refused to repatriate them."

"    *   """"____ ______________... _______"""" -> """"The report stated that..."""" or """"According to the report..."""""
"    *   """"______________ ISIS _________ ____________ ________ ________ _________________"""" -> """"Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters"""""
"    *   """"________ _______ ________ ______ _____________"""" -> """"European countries have refused to take them back / refuse repatriation."""""

"    *Draft 1:* According to the report, Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, and European countries have refused to send them back."
"    *Draft 2:* The report stated that Turkey would take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, while European countries have refused to repatriate them."

    *Let's look at the Tamil grammar again:*
"    """"____ ______________ [A] _______ [B] _______ _______."""""
    [A] = ______________ ISIS _________ ____________ ________ ________ _________________ (Turkey will take responsibility for protecting/holding captured ISIS fighters)
    [B] = ________ _______ ________ ______ _____________ (European countries have refused to send them back)

    *Synthesized:* The report stated that Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters and that European countries have refused to repatriate them.

"    """"According to the report, Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, and European countries have refused to take them back."""""

"    Or, more formal:"
"    """"The report stated that Turkey would take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, while European countries have refused to repatriate them."""""

"    """"According to the report, Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, and European countries have refused to take them back."""" (This is faithful and clear)."

    Let's try to match the flow of the Tamil sentence which connects the two facts.
"    """"The report stated that Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, and that European countries have refused to repatriate them."""""

"    """"According to the report, Turkey will take responsibility for the captured ISIS fighters, and European countries have refused to repatriate them."""""",0c8fca07f7e2452924d6d66de059750479f66845701ed75ed7da7ee72e6ddd44,stop,""{""""completion_tokens"""":919,""""prompt_tokens"""":115,""""prompt_tokens_details"""":{""""cached_tokens"""":7},""""total_tokens"""":1034}"",2026-10-19T16:59:44.252383+00:00"
