    *   Target language: English (`en`)
"    *   Text: """"___, _______ ______ __________ _________ ___ ______________ _______ _______ ________ ___________________. ______, _________ ____ ___________ _______ ______ _______ _____ _______ __________ _______ _______ _____________ ___________."""""

"    *   """"___"""" (Idhu): This / It."
"    *   """"_______ ______ __________ _________"""" (_rkkav__um parav_l_ga p_cippa_um ko_kaiy__a): already widely discussed theory/policy (in a scientific context, """"theory"""" is better)."
"    *   """"___ ______________ _______ _______ ________"""" (cila _ain_carka_ukku ma__um i_kaika_ iruppadhai): that only some dinosaurs had feathers."
