"translation:te:floresplus-te-26,1d16296f190dd8dabcdc7c92c6c703c74a83122676d56b4b1f0db7d5cc912071,translation,te,Telugu,floresplus-te-26,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Telugu to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""te\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""_________ ISIS _________ ____ Turkey ________ _____________, _________ ______ ______ ___________ _____ _________ ____________ ___ ______ ______ _________.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""A statement revealed that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries refused to allow them to return to their home countries."",""*   Source language: Telugu (te)"
    *   Target language: English (en)
"    *   Text: """"_________ ISIS _________ ____ Turkey ________ _____________, _________ ______ ______ ___________ _____ _________ ____________ ___ ______ ______ _________."""""

"    *   """"_________"""" (Pattubadina) -> Captured / Caught."
"    *   """"ISIS _________"""" (ISIS fighter-lanu) -> ISIS fighters."
"    *   """"____"""" (kooda) -> also / even."
"    *   """"Turkey ________ _____________"""" (Turkey swadheenam chesukuntundani) -> that Turkey takes possession/custody of / that Turkey detains."
"    *   """"_________ ______"""" (European deshalu) -> European countries."
"    *   """"______"""" (vatini) -> them (referring to the fighters)."
"    *   """"___________"""" (swadeshaniki) -> to their home countries."
"    *   """"_____ _________"""" (tiragi ravadadaniki) -> to return."
"    *   """"____________"""" (nirakarinchayi) -> refused / declined."
"    *   """"___ ______ ______ _________"""" (ani prakatana dwara telipindi) -> stated through a statement / a statement revealed that..."

"    *   *Literal:* It was stated through a statement that even captured ISIS fighters are being taken by Turkey, and European countries refused to have them return to their home countries."
"    *   *More natural:* A statement revealed that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries refused to take them back to their home countries."
"    *   *Polished:* A statement revealed that Turkey is also detaining captured ISIS fighters, as European countries have refused to allow them to return to their home countries."

    *   Meaning: Turkey is taking in/detaining ISIS fighters because Europe won't take them back.
"    *   Details: ISIS fighters, captured, Turkey takes custody, European countries refuse repatriation/return."
"    *   Tone: Informative, news-like."

"    """"A statement revealed that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries refused to allow them to return to their home countries."""""

"    *Self-Correction during drafting:* The Telugu phrase """"Turkey ________ _____________"""" implies Turkey is taking control/custody of them. The """"___ ______ ______ _________"""" means """"the statement revealed/stated that...""""."

    Let's refine for flow:
"    """"A statement revealed that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries refused to allow them to return to their home countries."""""

"    *Alternative:* """"A statement said that Turkey is also detaining captured ISIS fighters, as European countries have refused to accept their return to their home countries."""""

"    Let's go with a version that captures the """"even"""" (____) and the """"refusal"""" aspect clearly."

"    """"A statement revealed that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries have refused to allow them to return to their home countries."""""

"    *Wait, looking at the Telugu again:*"
"    """"_________ ISIS _________ ____ Turkey ________ _____________, _________ ______ ______ ___________ _____ _________ ____________ ___ ______ ______ _________."""""
    
"    """"It was stated in a statement that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries refused to allow them to return to their home countries."""""

    *Final Polish:*
"    """"A statement revealed that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries refused to allow them to return to their home countries."""""

