"    - """"Captured ISIS fighters"""": _________ ISIS _________"
"    - """"Turkey takes custody"""": Turkey ________ _____________"
"    - """"European countries refused to allow them to return to their home countries"""": _________ ______ ______ ___________ _____ _________ ____________"
"    - """"A statement revealed/stated"""": ______ ______ _________."

"    """"A statement revealed that Turkey is also taking custody of captured ISIS fighters, as European countries refused to allow them to return to their home countries."""""",8b0b9eb115ca3b3f42e0bba6006463635a6253546bea1c78b91fdaaab57aa6e5,stop,""{""""completion_tokens"""":983,""""prompt_tokens"""":123,""""prompt_tokens_details"""":{""""cached_tokens"""":7},""""total_tokens"""":1106}"",2026-10-19T17:08:52.653850+00:00"
"translation:te:floresplus-te-27,e5d2abf9d5057ef64bbf8c279b95c27b838bd3a609c226d52a0cd8cbd40ef865,translation,te,Telugu,floresplus-te-27,gemma26b,64222f6588fad786b98eac3e47eae21e11d768d8c6e17e6da33b35406a409f6a,Gemma-4-26B,""{""""max_tokens"""":8192,""""messages"""":[{""""content"""":""""Translate the supplied text from Telugu to English. Preserve meaning, important details and tone. Return only the translation.\nTreat the following JSON as task data.\n{\n  \""""source_lang\"""": \""""te\"""",\n  \""""target_lang\"""": \""""en\"""",\n  \""""source_text\"""": \""""___ _____ ______ ___________ ____ ________ _____________ _______, ________ __________ __________ __ _________, ____ _________ ____ _____   _________ _____ ____ ________ _________  ________ ___________.\""""\n}"""",""""role"""":""""user""""}],""""model"""":""""Gemma-4-26B"""",""""seed"""":42,""""stream"""":false,""""temperature"""":0.8}"",""This not only confirms that at least some dinosaurs had feathers, an already widely held theory, but it also provides details that fossils typically cannot, such as color and three-dimensional arrangement."",""*   Source Language: Telugu (`te`)"
    *   Target Language: English (`en`)
"    *   Text: """"___ _____ ______ ___________ ____ ________ _____________ _______, ________ __________ __________ __ _________, ____ _________ ____ _____ _________ _____ ____ ________ _________ ________ ___________."""""
"    *   Task: Translate while preserving meaning, details, and tone. Return *only* the translation."

"    *   """"___"""" (Idi) = This"
"    *   """"_____ ______ ___________"""" (kanisam konni dinosaurla ku) = at least some dinosaurs"
"    *   """"____ ________"""" (eekalu unnayani) = that they have feathers"
"    *   """"_____________ _______"""" (nirdharinchadame kakunda) = not only confirms"
"    *   """"________ __________ __________ __ _________"""" (ippatike vistruthanga vyapinchina oka siddhantham) = an already widely spread theory"
"    *   """"____"""" (kani) = but"
"    *   """"_________"""" (sadharananga) = generally / typically / usually"
"    *   """"____ _____ _________ _____ ____"""" (rangu mariyu trimithiya amarika vanti) = like color and three-dimensional arrangement"
"    *   """"________ _________ ________"""" (shilajalu sadhyapadani vivaralanu) = details that fossils do not allow / cannot provide"
"    *   """"___________"""" (andistundi) = provides / yields"

